    /* D280: the owner's turn accommodation. Lifting the mouse and putting it
       back down is hard, so one swipe keeps the camera turning. The Core
       does the latching (zs_engine.c stage_turn_assist): the turn is the
       swipe's own top speed through the config's own mouse translation, so
